flowchart LR
  ORG[AWS Organizations] --> OUs[Production / Staging / Sandbox OUs]
  OUs --> ACCT1[Member Account A]
  OUs --> ACCT2[Member Account B]
  OUs --> ACCTN[Member Account N]
  ORG --> SS[CloudFormation StackSet<br/>service-managed + auto deployment]
  SS --> ROLE[DiskMonitoringExecutionRole in member accounts]

  CTRL[Monitoring / Tooling Account<br/>Ansible Controller] -->|ListAccounts| ORG
  CTRL -->|STS AssumeRole| ROLE
  CTRL -->|SSM Session Manager| VM1[Linux EC2]
  CTRL -->|SSM Session Manager| VM2[Windows EC2]
  VM1 --> CWA1[CloudWatch Agent]
  VM2 --> CWA2[CloudWatch Agent]
  CWA1 --> CW[CloudWatch Enterprise/Disk]
  CWA2 --> CW
  CW --> DASH[Central Dashboards]
  CW --> ALARM[80/90/95% Alarms]
  ALARM --> SNS[SNS / Ticket / ChatOps]
  CTRL --> S3[S3 private encrypted transfer bucket]
  KMS[KMS CMK] --> S3
